  "title": "Actions & Java",
  "description": "Actions and Stuff, but on java 🍉, bringing new animations, textures and visual effects, which makes your world more alive 🍃 0.5.9 OUT NOW! 🔆",
  "body": "![Banner with the text: Actions & Java](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c7aefdfa47c8fe2b08bc764f832e1173a7b579c8.png)\n# 🍉 Actions & Java 🍉\n\n⛏️ Actions & Java is a **lightweight**, **content packed modpack** made to recreate the full **Actions & Stuff + Realistic Biomes** experience on Java, without directly stealing it. You can **easily configure** this modpack via unlinking the modpack in the modrinth app allowing you to **add your own mods or resourcepacks**, or even remove some mods or resourcepacks you don't like.\n\n🌸 Actions & Java features popular mods like [Hold My Items](https://modrinth.com/mod/hold-my-items), which adds new first player animations, [Fresh Animations](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/fresh-animations) for mob animations, [Fresh Animations: Player Extension](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/fa-player-extension) that enhances the player animations, [Resprited](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/resprited_infernalizard) for the smooth and beautiful new textures, [Weskerson's 3D Items](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/tools-and-utils) for 3D item models and more.\n\n🪄 If you **don't like** the **custom textures**, turn off **Resprited** (both) and **Allure x Fresh Animation** from the resource pack list and your **vanilla textures** will be **back**, or turn off any resource pack or mod you don't like!\n\n🌟 Actions & Java includes new **animation** for both **third person** and **first person**, **mob animations**, new **visual effects**, **3d items** and more, check below for the features Actions & Java offer. Check the **gallery for images**!\n\n## 📱 Features\n- ### ✨ Fresher Animations\n- ### 💧 Better Visual Effects\n- ### 🎨 Beautiful New Textures\n- ### 🦴 3D Item Models\n- ### 🪶 Lightweight\n- ### ⚙️ Easily Configurable\n- ### 🌱 Always Up-to-date and Uses Trustable Content\n\n## 🖼️ Pictures \n![3D Items](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/uzW6Wehm/images/b68e525f01693cc8ae762491fed74a0fb6022161.png)\n![Mangrove Swamp](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/uzW6Wehm/images/7b5ab3e5fdfc6201e3c000a8a61eaf61559b2e1d.png)\n![Desert with husks](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/uzW6Wehm/images/f7d5aef31ffe1700a1cb5ff6ca51747b060dfce8.png)\n![Savanna village](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/uzW6Wehm/images/80cf6d639598ba2e6ccaa85e2bf4c65a5ec3c565.png)\n![Taiga sunset](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/uzW6Wehm/images/f9d87d4c6eebb78f0fd889cff1e9f40ca81e7e72.png)\n### 🍉 Check the gallery for more pictures and gifs!\n> Some pictures and gifs may not be of the latest version, meaning some pictures are not up-to-date. If you want the latest pictures, check the current version and what version the picture was taken in.\n##\n<details>\n<summary>Copyright</summary>\nThis modpack contains mods which are the property of their respective creators. I do not claim ownership of any indivual mod. Please do not redistribute this modpack or use it for commercial purposes.\n\n</details>\n\n",
